      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You can frame Section 4(c) as an opportunity to emphasize the need for targeted support to small to medium-sized manufacturers, highlighting the bill's overall assistance for these enterprises. Instead of focusing solely on the perceived impact on mid-sized manufacturers, rephrase Section 4(c) to provide broader tax credits for smaller manufacturers or those in specific industries, such as clean energy or sustainable infrastructure. This will demonstrate your commitment to protecting domestic manufacturing. Additionally, you could emphasize the benefits of long-term incentives and ethanol backing for specific suppliers to ensure Senator Vance's support.",
